      "type": "fitness-fn",
      "label": "API Contract Compliance",
      "description": "Diffs the new OpenAPI document against the last released one (e.g. oasdiff, openapi-diff) and classifies changes as breaking or non-breaking; then runs contract tests generated from the spec against the built service. Consumer-driven contracts (Pact) can be added for internal APIs.",
